---
const contactInfo = [
  {
    title: 'Email',
    value: 'enriquegongora45@gmail.com',
    href: 'mailto:enriquegongora45@gmail.com',
    icon: '📧',
  },
  {
    title: 'WhatsApp',
    value: '+52 999 423 1687',
    href: 'https://wa.me/529994231687',
    icon: '💬',
  },
  {
    title: 'LinkedIn',
    value: 'luisenriquegongoraek',
    href: 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/luisenriquegongoraek',
    icon: '🔗',
  },
  {
    title: 'GitHub',
    value: 'legongoraek',
    href: 'https://github.com/legongoraek',
    icon: '💻',
  },
];
---

<section id="contacto" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-900 via-primary-800 to-primary-900 dark:from-slate-900 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 relative overflow-hidden">
  {/* Elementos decorativos */}
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white opacity-5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white opacity-5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        ¿Listo para trabajar juntos?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Tengo soluciones para tus proyectos. Contáctame y hablemos de cómo puedo ayudarte
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
      {contactInfo.map((item, index) => (
        <a
          href={item.href}
          target={item.href.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : '_self'}
          rel={item.href.startsWith('http') ? 'noopener noreferrer' : ''}
          class="group card bg-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/20 dark:hover:bg-white/10"
          style={`animation-delay: ${index * 0.1}s`}
        >
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <span class="text-4xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">{item.icon}</span>
            <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-100 uppercase tracking-wide">{item.title}</p>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-1 truncate group-hover:text-blue-100 transition">
                {item.value}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 border border-white/20 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12 backdrop-blur-sm text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Envíame un mensaje directo
      </h3>
      <p class="text-blue-100 mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Respondo rápidamente a todas las consultas. Cuéntame sobre tu proyecto y qué necesitas.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:enriquegongora45@gmail.com"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-white text-primary-900 font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition inline-block"
        >
          Enviar Email
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/529994231687"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-green-500 text-white font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-green-600 transition inline-block"
        >
          WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Tiempo de respuesta */}
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm">
        ⏱️ Tiempo de respuesta promedio: <span class="font-bold">24 horas</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .card {
    animation: slideUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @keyframes slideUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
